    "instructions": "1. Combine the 3 sage leaves and the cinnamon syrup in a cocktail shaker and use a muddler to lightly crush the sage.\n2. Add the lime juice and bourbon.\n3. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n4. Strain into a coupe and garnish with a sage leaf.",
